# Coding rules (summary; full text in `CODING_RULES.md`)

- Doc block on every exported function in <<CODE_COMMENT_LANGUAGE>>, non-technical-reader-friendly.
- No empty catch blocks. No `console.*` in production code.
- Loading / empty / error states on every screen.
- Never trust client claims for authorisation — re-check on server.
- Never commit secrets. Reference env vars only.
- Update `STATE.md` + `CHANGELOG.md` + (if relevant) `CLIENT_DOCS.md` in the same diff as the code change.
